            "pinyin": "qù fàndiàn",
            "meaning_en": "Go to a restaurant."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "我想去酒店",
            "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng qù jiǔdiàn",
            "meaning_en": "I want to go to the hotel."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "我想去北京饭店",
            "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng qù Běijīng Fàndiàn",
            "meaning_en": "I want to go to the Beijing Hotel."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "我想去你那儿",
            "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng qù nǐ nàr",
            "meaning_en": "I want to go to your place."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "我不想在这儿吃",
            "pinyin": "wǒ bù xiǎng zài zhèr chī",
            "meaning_en": "I do not want to eat here."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "你想去哪儿喝",
            "pinyin": "nǐ xiǎng qù nǎr hē",
            "meaning_en": "Where would you like to go for a drink?"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "北京饭店在哪儿",
            "pinyin": "Běijīng Fàndiàn zài nǎr",
            "meaning_en": "Where is the Beijing Hotel?"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "你想去酒店吗",
            "pinyin": "nǐ xiǎng qù jiǔdiàn ma",
            "meaning_en": "Do you want to go to the hotel?"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "去你那儿",
            "pinyin": "qù nǐ nàr",
            "meaning_en": "Go to your place."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "去我那儿",
