            "pinyin": "wǒ xiǎng zài zhèr chī",
            "meaning_en": "I want to eat here."
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "北京饭店",
            "pinyin": "Běijīng Fàndiàn",
            "meaning_en": "Beijing Hotel; hotel name"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "咖啡厅",
            "pinyin": "kāfēitīng",
            "meaning_en": "café"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "饭店",
            "pinyin": "fàndiàn",
            "meaning_en": "restaurant; hotel, context-dependent"
          },
          {
            "hanzi": "酒店",
            "pinyin": "jiǔdiàn",
            "meaning_en": "hotel"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "guided-speaking",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "text": "Speaking task: Invite a friend to a café, restaurant or hotel; decline one place and suggest another."
      },
      {
        "id": "source-coverage-dialogue",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "title": "Meeting at a Café Rather Than a Hotel",
        "turns": [
          {
            "speaker": "A",
            "hanzi": "明天我们在哪儿见面？",
            "pinyin": "Míngtiān wǒmen zài nǎr jiànmiàn?",
            "english": "Where shall we meet tomorrow?"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "B",
            "hanzi": "你想去北京饭店吗？",
            "pinyin": "Nǐ xiǎng qù Běijīng Fàndiàn ma?",
            "english": "Would you like to go to the Beijing Hotel?"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "A",
            "hanzi": "我不想去酒店。咖啡厅怎么样？",
            "pinyin": "Wǒ bù xiǎng qù jiǔdiàn. Kāfēitīng zěnmeyàng?",
            "english": "I would rather not go to a hotel. How about a café?"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "B",
            "hanzi": "好，我们在咖啡厅见。",
            "pinyin": "Hǎo, wǒmen zài kāfēitīng jiàn.",
            "english": "Fine, let us meet at the café."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
